{"t":"Emperor's Cookies Quest","s":"emperor-s-cookies-quest-5d489","k":"quest","i":"assets/wiki/Emperor_s_Cookies_Quest_d8290c.jpg","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Emperor's Cookies Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Kazordoon Cookie Quest, Emperor Kruzak Quest</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0<br/>(20+ recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6.1<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 23, 2000<br/>Christmas Update 2000</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Emperor%20Kruzak\">Emperor Kruzak</a> has some cookies for you.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p>Nothing but <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Guard\">Dwarf Guards</a> if you take the wrong way.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203800\">Key 3800</a>, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Bag\">bag</a> with 20+7 <a href=\"#/wiki/Cookie\">cookies</a> &amp; <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203801\">Key 3801</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203802\">Key 3802</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Required_Equipment\">Required Equipment</span></h3>\n<p>None, (Maybe a <a href=\"#/wiki/Rope\">rope</a>)\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method\">Method</span></h3>\n<ul><li>First you need to go to <a href=\"#/wiki/Emperor%20Kruzak\">Emperor Kruzak</a>'s chambers in his private room, to the north, get <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203800\">Key 3800</a> which can be found at the end of the west \"secret passage\" exit, in a <a href=\"#/wiki/Chest%20%28Quest%29\">Chest (Quest)</a> <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32605,31909,3\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32605, 31909, 3)</a>.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Do not take the exit route down the hole, but go back to the king's room; you have to open the door of the small room in the emperor's chamber with the <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203800\">key</a>. In the chest in the room you opened will be 7 and 20 <a href=\"#/wiki/Cookie\">Cookies</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203801\">Key 3801</a>.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>To get to the (<a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203802\">3802</a>) you can go in 2 ways:\n<ol><li>You can go down several levels from the \"secret passage\" until you come out under <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a> (ground level). To get to the next key you need a <a href=\"#/wiki/Rope\">rope</a> and have to go to the barracks. How to get to Kazordoon entrance can be seen <a href=\"#/wiki/Route%3AKazordoon\">here</a>.</li>\n<li>(faster way) Go back to the barracks.</li></ol></li></ul>\n<ul><li>When at the barracks (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32601,31927,6\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32601, 31927, 6)</a>) you can open the door with <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203801\">Key 3801</a>, in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Chest%20%28Quest%29\">Chest (Quest)</a> will be the key, <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203802\">Key 3802</a>, this key is needed to open <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwacatra\">Dwacatra</a> Prison and a specific room in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Mines\">Dwarf Mines</a>, the <a href=\"#/wiki/Mine%20Hub\">Mine Hub</a>.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Emperor's Cookies Quest\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"535\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Emperor_s_Cookies_Quest_d8290c.jpg\" width=\"671\"/></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>","quests":["what-a-foolish-quest"]}